den's frame: IRONMAW Oxide, Tonal plates (spec, "Look and layout").
No boxes: plates are told apart by tone, slate sutures mark where they meet,
and the detail plate has the one chamfer.

Colours are engine sentinels, replaced with palette roles before the colour profile
is applied (vendor/raudbjorn-tui/src/theme/mod.rs):
  aa0000 bg (charcoal)       aa0001..aa0003 surface 1..3   aa0004 border
  aa0005 text   aa0006 text strong   aa0007 text muted   aa0008 text faint
  aa0009 teal: actionable    aa000a structure text         aa000b rust: the one action, you are here
  aa000d success   aa000e error   aa000f amber: caution     aa0016 slate: structure
  aa0017 selected   aa0018 mark plate   aa0019 border strong   aa001a rust hover

Every meaning carried by colour must also be carried by a glyph or text.
Text above the first section is ignored by the parser.

--- Header
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0018]
  div h-[1]
  div h-[1] flex-row px-2
    span w-[5] font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{brand}"
    span w-[3] text-[#aa0016] " ┊ "
    span flex-1 text-[#aa000a] "{scope}"
    for item in scopes
      span w-[1] " "
      if {active}
        span w-[16] bg-[#aa0009] text-[#aa0000] font-bold "{segment}"
      else
        span w-[16] bg-[#aa0001] text-[#aa0007] "{segment}"
  div h-[1] flex-row px-2
    span flex-1 text-[#aa0007] "{status}"
  div h-[1] flex-row px-2
    if {coverage_complete}
      span w-[2] text-[#aa000d] "{complete_glyph}"
      span flex-1 text-[#aa0008] "{coverage}"
    else
      span w-[2] text-[#aa000f] "{incomplete_glyph}"
      span flex-1 text-[#aa000f] "{coverage}"

--- Footer
div w-full h-full flex-row bg-[#aa0000] text-[#aa0007] px-2
  for item in hints
    span w-[4] font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{key}"
    span w-[10] "{label}"
  span flex-1

--- SutureV
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0000] text-[#aa0016]
  for row in rows
    div h-[1] "┊"

--- Chamfer
div w-full h-full bg-[#aa0000] text-[#aa0002]
  span "{chamfer}"

--- MarkPlate
div w-full h-full bg-[#aa0018]

--- Rail
div w-full h-full bg-[#aa0001]

--- Splash
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0018]
  div flex-1
  div h-[1] text-center font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{brand}"
  div h-[1] text-center text-[#aa000a] "{title}"
  div h-[1] text-center text-[#aa0008] "{detail}"
  div h-[2]

--- Notice
div w-full h-full flex-row bg-[#aa0000] px-2
  span w-[2] text-[#aa000f] "{glyph}"
  span flex-1 text-[#aa000f] "{text}"
